# shapes

Native bindings for shapes

WebAssembly bindings for a `wasm32-unknown-unknown` build of the `shapes` library, linked with `--export-table --growable-table` (for example `RUSTFLAGS="-C link-arg=--export-table -C link-arg=--growable-table"`). `init()` loads `shapes.wasm` from next to this package, or from the path in `SHAPES_LIBRARY` on Node.js; pass a URL, bytes, or a compiled module to load it from elsewhere:

```js
import { init, shapes } from 'shapes';

await init();
```

<!-- END README.md -->
